silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_07_sections_01_concrete_anchor_4#headobs77 silm:hasLongDescription "The HeadObs77 is the head-observation leg; a named source leg of paper 19. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'HeadObs77', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
